<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A0.F6.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 6</span>: </span><span id="A0.F6.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Last accuracy of every Task in 10 steps. The Last accuracy of Task <math id="A0.F6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A0.F6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{1,2,...,10\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{1,2,...,10\}</annotation></semantics></math> is the Top-1 accuracy over all the previous Tasks (i.e., Tasks <math id="A0.F6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,2,...,t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,2,...,t</annotation></semantics></math>). The results in <span id="A0.F6.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">left</span> and <span id="A0.F6.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">middle</span> are conducted on CIFAR100. The result of ”Ours” in <span id="A0.F6.12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">left</span> is based on ViT-L/14 and in <span id="A0.F6.12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">middle</span> and <span id="A0.F6.12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">right</span> are based on ViT-B/16.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
